+
+The hypotheses require an odd prime power `k` with `10 | (k-1)` and
+`p=(k+1)/2` prime.  Direct enumeration of the admissible prime powers begins
+
+| `k` | `p=(k+1)/2` | graph order `10p` |
+|---:|---:|---:|
+| 61 | 31 | **310** |
+| 81 | 41 | 410 |
+| 121 | 61 | 610 |
+| 361 | 181 | 1810 |
